note What counts as a place: the tour by TourName, the step by StepId, the focused symbol as a SymbolKey (file path, symbol name) and the file by its path, never slots or ids, so an entry still finds its place after a re-index, a reload of the map, or steps moving or being removed. The centre tab is compared, so a tab switch is a place. Scroll offsets, the line selection and the camera ride along to be restored. Only a jump counts a changed line selection.

