symbol go
lines 0 24
hash 14475bdae7309b69
note Restoring a place without it counting as a new navigation: it overwrites the last-frame snapshot, so track_navigation sees no difference at the end of this frame. The tour is found by name and the step by StepId; when either is gone only the symbol is restored, and a place with no symbol clears the focus. The step is selected with Scrolling::Stay and the pending scroll requests are cleared, then the document and Source scroll offsets and the graph camera (restore_camera, so nothing looks, glides or fits) are set to what they were when the place was left. The tab is set last, because selecting a step switches the tab on its own.

