file crates/gui/src/nav.rs
symbol track_navigation
lines 0 19
hash 379a38b0b159beaf
note Called by the frame once at the very end, after the frame's actions have been applied and the views have reported their scroll offsets. A back or forward asked for this frame (go_at_frame_end) is performed first. Then the kind of move the frame made is read and reset to Select, and when the place moved from last frame's, the old place, with the viewport it was left at, is pushed and the forward stack dropped, exactly like a browser; every such move is pushed, a walk and a tab switch included. The snapshot is refreshed every frame either way, so a scroll updates the place being left without becoming its own entry. The history keeps the last two hundred places.

